---
// Optional: Bisa mengambil quote dari config, tapi untuk sekarang kita pakai hardcode sesuai tema
---

<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center fade-in-section relative z-10">
    <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto rounded-full bg-[#e1eef4] flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-[#34495e] mb-6 shadow-sm">
      <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif text-[#2c3e50]">Cerita Cinta Kami</h2>
    <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-[#a6c4df] mx-auto my-5"></div>
    
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-[#34495e] italic font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      “berawal dari serangkaian momen tak terduga, hingga akhirnya kami memutuskan untuk saling melengkapi perjalanan hidup bersama.”
    </p>
    
    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-3 text-[#7b8d9f] text-sm">
      <span class="border border-[#b6d0e8] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">🌿 Jakarta · 2026</span>
      <span class="border border-[#b6d0e8] px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">🌿 forever</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <!-- decorative floral -->
  <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 text-[140px] opacity-10 rotate-12 select-none" style="color:#a6c4df;">🌾</div>
  <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 text-[120px] opacity-10 -rotate-12 select-none" style="color:#a6c4df;">🌸</div>
</section>
